{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026UAZa8Dik891795503452.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>股評人黃敏碩於節目中百勝中國(9987)，除了公司是內地營收規模最大的餐飲集團，業務實力較有韌性，上季度淨新增門店有近700間，盈利增速亦跑贏收入增速，因此有資金追捧。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"2323.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xU9JBz00JH1795503460.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>黃敏碩建議現價397.2元買入，目標價看430元，止蝕價定於357元。</p><p></p><p>百勝中國(9987)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：現價→$397.2</p><p>目標：$430</p><p>止蝕：$357</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"2324.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lsj2xKrn4N1795503474.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>股評人蘇沛豐推介微軟(MSFT)，指公司AI雲收入增長強勁，而且財政穩健，維持正自由現金流，對AI資本開支的憂慮較少，加上估值接近五年低位，現水平吸引。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"2325.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Kj2fxGYPpf1795503503.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>蘇沛豐建議夜盤現價即493.28美元買入，目標價看555美元，止蝕價定於450美元。</p><p></p><p>微軟(MSFT)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：現價→493.28美元</p><p>目標：555美元</p><p>止蝕：450美元</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"2326.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yA9hQCypCA1795503518.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T07:43:57.704731+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":338,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T06:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T09:57:14.739724+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T07:37:20.463222+00:00","content_hash":"9191af841725452bcc4c542fc0a9bd7427daa2bc933ca351feefd96e0e64e4b4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T07:43:57.704731+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}